{
  "_comment": [
    "Every Setting name the RPCS3 wiki's per-game Configuration tables use, and",
    "what it becomes in this core. 'setting' names the declared setting it maps",
    "onto, with 'values' translating the wiki's option text; null means the core",
    "does not expose it, with 'why'. tools/wiki-import.py REFUSES a harvest that",
    "contains a name not listed here, so the wiki cannot grow a recommendation",
    "that this core silently ignores. A value missing from 'values' is reported",
    "per game as unsupported - it is never rounded to the nearest option."
  ],
